                        "version": 0,
                        "content": "The nurse provides medication instructions to a client who has a prescription for sucralfate to be taken 4 times daily. Which statement by the client indicates teaching was effective?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "a0f7d178f7b728b8bba7ef20ddeca62d",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Evaluating 评价",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nSucralfate is a gastric protectant. The medication should be scheduled for administration 1 hour before meals and at bedtime. The medication is scheduled so that it has time to bind to the base of ulcers and erosions and form a protective coating before food intake stimulates chemical and mechanical irritation in the stomach. Medication should not be stopped. Side effects are minimal, and diarrhea is not associated with the medication.",
                        "id": "086bcfdd36294b83a95ec592218499a5",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "a3827f5718f24718af55d15c2e44da4c",
                                "content": "At bedtime"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "dde5bf5951fc4be38eeec74c95442fbd",
                                "content": "With breakfast"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "23c904ce44df49cd815e1ba3fbcfcd99",
                                "content": "With the noon meal"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "63e07a5f8b95451aa9474411d1b04d54",
                                "content": "On an empty stomach"
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
