                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Evaluating 评价",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nPancrelipase is a pancreatic enzyme used as a digestive aid for clients with pancreatitis. It would reduce the amount of fatty stools (steatorrhea). Another recognized beneficial effect is improved nutritional status. It is not used to treat heartburn or abdominal pain and does not regulate blood glucose.",
