                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Evaluating 评价",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nThe most rapid results from bisacodyl occur when it is taken on an empty stomach. If it is taken at bedtime, the client will have a bowel movement in the morning. It will not have a rapid effect if taken with a large meal or with two glasses of milk.",
